# THE WEDGE. Eight files and everything in them, one blob, token count.
#
# GENERATED shape, hand-written content. Re-record with `make -C demo`.
Source common.tape
Source setup.tape
Output out/bundle.gif
Set Height 720

Sleep 700ms
Type "chute bundle src/auth src/api | head -16"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Sleep 1.2s
